## Supabase URL (Dashboard / Reference)
SUPABASE_URL="https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/your-project-id"

## Database connection string (Transaction pooler)
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres.your-project-id:your-password@aws-1-ap-southeast-1.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres"

## API Publishable key (Anon Key)
API_PUBLIC_KEY="your_supabase_publishable_anon_key"

## API Secret key (Service Role Key)
API_SECRET_KEY="your_supabase_service_role_key"
